          "731970901": {
            "id": "731970901",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Fadhlan",
            "text": "\"It would seem that, while The Seven stand shoulder-to-shoulder in their roles as Archons of the mortal realm, there are moments where their paths diverge and even run directly counter to one another.\""
